"""Offline smart DSP strategy search for soundcheck and live-assist proposals.

The engine compares several DSP strategies for the same audible problem and
returns the safest, fastest operator-review proposal. It is intentionally
transport-free: no mixer clients, no OSC, no queue import, and no live apply.
"""

